3727
03:24:34,430 --> 03:24:35,670
Dude, this place is crazy.

3728
03:24:37,650 --> 03:24:39,010
So much stuff happening here.

3729
03:24:41,550 --> 03:24:41,970
Whoa.

3730
03:24:43,870 --> 03:24:46,270
Oh, oh, okay, that's, don't want to fall down there.

3731
03:24:53,370 --> 03:24:54,890
I really do need more arrows.

3732
03:24:55,450 --> 03:24:57,050
I don't know what happened to my one arrow.

3733
03:24:59,070 --> 03:25:01,290
I have infinity, so it must have just...

3734
03:25:01,870 --> 03:25:03,610
