Next.

3790
03:28:32,030 --> 03:28:36,530
You really want to be careful when you go arrow to arrow against these guys.

3791
03:28:39,030 --> 03:28:40,330
They will murder you.

3792
03:28:45,450 --> 03:28:46,670
Wait, did my...

3793
03:28:47,610 --> 03:28:50,170
Did my fire arrow just melt the snow?

3794
03:28:50,950 --> 03:28:51,570
What?

3795
03:28:53,910 --> 03:28:55,210
You can do that?

3796
03:28:58,710 --> 03:28:59,750
Mind blown!

3797
03:29:02,670 --> 03:29:06,390
I was wondering why they got excavated when I shot them.

3798
03:29:08,270 --> 03:29:11,250
I feel like I'm learning so many crazy new things today.

3799
03:29:12,910 --> 03:29:14,050
way more than usual.

3800
03:29:18,100 --> 03:29:19,360
Also, soon level 30.

3801
03:29:21,680 --> 03:29:22,960
That's cause for celebration.

3802
03:29:25,400 --> 03:29:27,180
I even got a little key here.

3803
03:29:28,140 --> 03:29:28,780
Oh, arrows.

3804
03:29:32,130 --> 03:29:33,030
Can I need those?

3805
