I do wonder if they can still activate when they're in this state.

3810
03:29:50,320 --> 03:29:51,720
Only one way to find out, I guess.

3811
03:29:54,220 --> 03:29:56,360
So this one is still in that state, or...

3812
03:29:56,360 --> 03:29:56,900
It's not.

3813
03:29:57,020 --> 03:29:58,500
Okay, so let me just do this.

3814
03:29:59,740 --> 03:30:00,800
Now it's in that state.

3815
03:30:02,740 --> 03:30:03,440
Put it over there.

3816
03:30:03,480 --> 03:30:04,380
Is this one in that state?

3817
03:30:04,840 --> 03:30:05,400
It is.

3818
03:30:05,540 --> 03:30:05,700
Okay.

3819
03:30:09,650 --> 03:30:09,970
Diamonds.

3820
03:30:11,590 --> 03:30:13,550
I mean, I can't not take it when I see it.

3821
03:30:16,650 --> 03:30:18,190
I'm going to be nasty and use a slab.

3822
03:30:28,750 --> 03:30:30,270
Oh, my rails are gone.

3823
03:30:37,000 --> 03:30:37,980
Where did I put them?

3824
03:30:38,240 --> 03:30:38,460
Oh.

3825
03:30:41,490 --> 03:30:42,870
Let's dig that way now.

3826
03:30:43,190 --> 03:30:44,630
I'm going to take this side here.

3827
03:30:45,970 --> 03:30:48,270
And I think we had 12, so...

3828
03:30:48,270 --> 03:30:50,430
One, two, three, four, five.

3829
03:31:11,250 --> 03:31:14,730
God, it's so cathartic, actually, just destroying this place.

3830
03:31:17,190 --> 03:31:19,470
It brings me great pleasure.

3831
03:31:21,170 --> 03:31:25,550
And would you look at that, it even picks up these guys without destroying them.

3832
03:31:26,090 --> 03:31:27,450
They are fully assembled.

3833
03:31:29,990 --> 03:31:30,950
Isn't that interesting?

3834
03:31:36,300 --> 03:31:38,100
And who knows what else it finds on the way.

3835
03:31:43,320 --> 03:31:45,040
I want to get a side profile of this.

3836
03:31:49,750 --> 03:31:50,870
Oh, oh my...

3837
03:31:51,370 --> 03:31:52,570
I thought I heard something.

3838
03:31:57,700 --> 03:31:58,180
Long...

3839
03:31:58,180 --> 03:31:59,360
Yeah, I can shoot longer than you.

3840
03:32:01,380 --> 03:32:03,700
You're a Mongolian archer.

3841
03:32:03,940 --> 03:32:05,360
I'm an English longbowman.

3842
03:32:07,280 --> 03:32:08,260
You can't win.

3843
