So these still work, it seems.

3849
03:32:28,850 --> 03:32:30,690
Oh, I should have gone one more to the left.

3850
03:32:30,750 --> 03:32:31,010
Look at this.

3851
03:32:31,050 --> 03:32:32,830
This is very unsatisfactory.

3852
03:32:44,590 --> 03:32:46,690
I think when we reach the end here, we're gonna stop.

3853
03:32:47,230 --> 03:32:48,270
We're gonna go home.

3854
03:32:49,030 --> 03:32:49,870
We have enough.

3855
03:32:52,610 --> 03:32:53,610
Let's not be greedy.

3856
03:32:59,410 --> 03:33:01,450
This is such a weird dynamic now.

3857
03:33:01,810 --> 03:33:06,510
Just having this power to be able to dig like this in Minecraft.

3858
03:33:11,470 --> 03:33:13,270
I'm surprised we aren't full yet.

3859
03:33:13,450 --> 03:33:13,770
Honestly.

3860
03:33:15,630 --> 03:33:21,930
Just the amount of surface area compared to the previous generation of digging machine is substantially bigger.

3861
03:33:23,490 --> 03:33:26,870
And yet, it doesn't feel like it's filling up chests faster.

3862
03:33:30,890 --> 03:33:31,550
Stop now.

3863
03:33:35,480 --> 03:33:36,460
Okay, let's go home.

3864
03:33:37,100 --> 03:33:38,440
