Oh, I think it's up there.

3867
03:33:48,550 --> 03:33:49,130
Oh god.

3868
03:33:50,890 --> 03:33:52,070
It is right there.

3869
03:33:52,610 --> 03:33:53,090
There.

3870
03:33:54,630 --> 03:33:55,330
That's the spot.

3871
03:34:13,300 --> 03:34:14,780
If I die, it's because of the fish now.

3872
03:34:15,540 --> 03:34:16,620
They actually blocked me.

3873
03:34:27,010 --> 03:34:28,110
Wow, it's just not enough.

3874
03:34:37,370 --> 03:34:39,190
Okay, we have plenty of stuff.

3875
03:34:39,370 --> 03:34:41,970
We may even have enough clay now to last us a lifetime.

3876
03:34:47,590 --> 03:34:50,090
Ah, we didn't actually dig through that much clay.

3877
03:34:50,230 --> 03:34:52,130
It was only that one time when I started digging, too.

3878
03:34:53,310 --> 03:34:55,050
But, uh, copper and stuff?

3879
03:34:55,150 --> 03:34:55,630
Oh yeah, for sure.

3880
03:34:55,790 --> 03:34:56,110
And tough?

3881
03:34:56,250 --> 03:34:56,870
Ooh, yes.

3882
03:34:57,070 --> 03:34:58,710
I think we can make something cool out of tough.

3883
03:35:02,880 --> 03:35:05,380
