3884
03:35:05,880 --> 03:35:07,320
God, it feels so good.

3885
03:35:07,820 --> 03:35:09,100
It's already clean.

3886
03:35:09,760 --> 03:35:10,460
Dang.

3887
03:35:12,300 --> 03:35:14,920
Oh, I do need, I do need one rail.

3888
03:35:17,480 --> 03:35:18,220
Rail.

3889
03:35:21,770 --> 03:35:22,510
Thanks.

3890
03:35:24,030 --> 03:35:25,390
Was he just burping?

3891
03:35:25,930 --> 03:35:27,030
Sounded like a burp.

3892
03:35:34,050 --> 03:35:34,810
Okay, what do we got?

3893
03:35:34,910 --> 03:35:35,630
We got clay.

3894
03:35:36,390 --> 03:35:37,830
I'm gonna take all the clay first.

3895
03:35:42,730 --> 03:35:44,590
Just to get a stock of what we have here.

3896
03:35:47,800 --> 03:35:48,960
Oh, yeah.

3897
03:35:50,360 --> 03:35:53,240
Very, I'm taking all the smeltables.

3898
03:35:53,420 --> 03:35:53,900
Oh my god.

3899
03:35:56,640 --> 03:35:57,360
Holy shit!

3900
03:36:01,230 --> 03:36:02,830
And, uh, how did this work now?

3901
03:36:02,830 --> 03:36:03,350
I can do...

3902
03:36:05,430 --> 03:36:06,090
No, no, wait.

3903
03:36:06,810 --> 03:36:07,830
Uh, brick.

3904
03:36:12,210 --> 03:36:13,210
You just blast it.

3905
03:36:13,350 --> 03:36:13,930
That's all you do.

3906
03:36:15,090 --> 03:36:16,170
It's just blasting.

3907
03:36:16,730 --> 03:36:19,930
Now, I wonder, can we get experience on top of it all?

3908
03:36:29,670 --> 03:36:30,030
Really?

3909
03:36:37,690 --> 03:36:45,830
That's the first time I've seen, uh, a thing you can only do with the bulk blasting that you can't do with the normal blaster.

3910
03:36:49,030 --> 03:36:49,750
That's weird.

3911
03:36:54,150 --> 03:36:55,610
Yeah, it doesn't even show over here.

3912
03:36:55,790 --> 03:36:57,650
I guess I can always just look here and see what I can do.

3913
03:36:57,650 --> 03:36:58,710
In fact, wait a minute.

3914
03:37:01,790 --> 03:37:03,190
Oh, oh, okay, it works here.

3915
03:37:03,350 --> 03:37:03,630
Never mind.

3916
03:37:06,570 --> 03:37:07,110
Alright, cool.

3917
03:37:08,370 --> 03:37:09,490
Is that experience, though?

3918
03:37:12,310 --> 03:37:14,050
It is, but it's very slow.

3919
03:37:14,430 --> 03:37:15,810
So, the rest I'm just going to blast.

3920
03:37:18,150 --> 03:37:21,130
And I may have to set up a new blaster because I don't know what the deal is with this blaster.

3921
03:37:21,170 --> 03:37:22,030
What was I thinking?

3922
03:37:24,490 --> 03:37:25,490
What did I put in there?

3923
03:37:28,900 --> 03:37:29,680
What does that say?

3924
03:37:31,780 --> 03:37:34,400
Ah, okay, let's add this then.

3925
03:37:37,120 --> 03:37:38,300
Maybe, yeah, we got that already.

3926
03:37:38,460 --> 03:37:38,540
Okay.

3927
03:37:39,600 --> 03:37:39,820
Sweet.

3928
03:37:47,780 --> 03:37:48,680
